---
---
<section id="video" class="dark-section">
  <div class="container video-grid">
    <div>
      <span class="section-tag">Demo video</span>
      <h2>Vezi cum funcționează în 60 de secunde</h2>
      <p class="mt-1">De la înregistrare la chatbot live pe site-ul tău — totul în mai puțin de un minut.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="video-placeholder">
      <div class="play-btn">
        <span class="play-icon">▶</span>
      </div>
      <div class="video-label">MyChatbot — Demo 60 secunde</div>
      <div class="video-sub">Video YouTube · disponibil în curând</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .dark-section {
    background: #0f172a;
    border-bottom: none;
  }
  .dark-section h2 { color: white; }
  .dark-section p  { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7); }
  .dark-section .section-tag { color: #38bdf8; }

  .video-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 3rem;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .video-placeholder {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e293b, #0c1524);
    border: 0.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
    border-radius: 12px;
    aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 12px;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .play-btn {
    width: 56px; height: 56px;
    background: #ef4444;
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    transition: transform 0.2s;
  }
  .play-btn:hover { transform: scale(1.1); }
  .play-icon { color: white; font-size: 20px; margin-left: 4px; }
  .video-label { font-size: 13px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7); }
  .video-sub   { font-size: 11px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.35); }
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .video-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
</style>
